<title>JAPAN: Henderson first traded at 1,140 yen in Tokyo.</title>
<headline>Henderson first traded at 1,140 yen in Tokyo.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Henderson Land Development Co Ltd, a major property developer based in Hong Kong, were first traded at 1,140 yen on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It was the first day of trading for the shares on the TSE. The firm has issued 33 million new shares.</p>
</text>
